  - id: trials_wisdom_gift
    displayName: Trials, Wisdom, and the Perfect Gift
    flavorText: James teaches that the trying of faith through trials produces patience,
      and that every good and perfect gift descends from the unchanging Father of
      lights.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: The trying of faith through trials produces patience, and every good
      and perfect gift comes down from the unchanging Father of lights.
    deliveredByManagerId: james_brother_of_jesus
