  - id: doers_of_the_word
    displayName: Doers of the Word
    flavorText: James urges believers to be swift to hear, slow to speak, and doers
      of the word rather than hearers only, since pure religion visits orphans and
      widows in their affliction.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Believers must be doers of the word and not hearers only, since pure
      religion is to visit the fatherless and widows and to keep oneself unspotted
      from the world.
    deliveredByManagerId: james_brother_of_jesus
    managerId: doers_of_the_word
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
