    submanagers: []
  - id: taming_the_tongue
    displayName: Taming the Tongue
    flavorText: James likens the tongue to a bit that turns a horse and a spark that
      sets a forest ablaze, an unruly evil that no man can tame.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: The tongue, though small, is a fire that can set a life ablaze and can
      be tamed by no man, so blessing and cursing ought not to come from the same
      mouth.
    deliveredByManagerId: james_brother_of_jesus
    managerId: taming_the_tongue
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
