  - id: wisdom_from_above
    displayName: Wisdom From Above
    flavorText: James contrasts earthly, devilish wisdom marked by envy and strife
      with the wisdom from above, which is pure, peaceable, and full of mercy.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Earthly, devilish wisdom breeds envy and strife, while the wisdom from
      above is pure, peaceable, gentle, and full of mercy and good fruits.
    deliveredByManagerId: james_brother_of_jesus
    managerId: wisdom_from_above
