  - id: wars_worldliness_humility
    displayName: Wars, Worldliness, and Humility
    flavorText: James traces wars and quarrels among believers to their own inward
      lusts, calling them to submit to God, resist the devil, and humble themselves
      before the Lord.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Wars and quarrels among believers spring from their own lusts; James
      calls them to submit to God, resist the devil, and humble themselves so God
      may lift them up.
    deliveredByManagerId: james_brother_of_jesus
    managerId: wars_worldliness_humility
