  - id: presumption_of_riches
    displayName: The Presumption of Riches
    flavorText: James pronounces a woe on oppressive rich men whose hoarded riches
      are corrupted and whose withheld wages cry out to the Lord of Sabaoth.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: James warns presumptuous merchants that life is but a vapor, and pronounces
      a woe on oppressive rich men whose hoarded wealth and withheld wages testify
      against them.
    deliveredByManagerId: james_brother_of_jesus
    managerId: presumption_of_riches
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
