  - id: patience_unto_the_lord
    displayName: Patience Unto the Coming of the Lord
    flavorText: James calls believers to patience unto the coming of the Lord, likening
      it to a farmer awaiting the early and latter rain, and points to Job's endurance.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Believers are called to patience unto the Lord's coming, like a husbandman
      awaiting the harvest rain, taking the prophets and Job as examples of suffering
      and endurance.
    deliveredByManagerId: james_brother_of_jesus
    managerId: patience_unto_the_lord
